{"title":"Salmon Run @ Etienne Brulé Park","startsAt":"2026-10-10T13:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-10T15:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Ready to witness a natural wonder right here in the city?\n\nJoin us for a chill walk to see the **salmon run** at Etienne Brulé Park! We'll meet up at **Etienne Brulé Park Parking** and take a stroll along the Humber River, where we'll watch the salmon jump and splash their way upstream.\nIt's a sight you won't want to miss!\n\nAfter our walk, let's grab a coffee and a snack to relax and chat about what we saw. It's the perfect way to spend an afternoon and connect with fellow nature lovers.\n\n**Meeting spot:** Etienne Brulé Park Parking lot\n**What to bring:** Just comfy shoes and a sense of adventure!\n\n$2 event fee, cash at the event or etransfer: mech.mandeep@gmail.com","venue":{"name":"Etienne Brulé Park","address":"4-6 Catherine St, Toronto","lat":43.651608,"lng":-79.49022,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":{"amount":2,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"Vibe & Wander","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/4/3/highres_530222627.jpeg"}